{"Categories":[9],"HiddenTopics":[],"Topics":[4],"Id":148,"TextResource":{"Name":"modulo-de-informacion-nuevo-pudahuel","Translations":[{"Text":"Módulo de información NP","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Módulo de información NP","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"3","Id":16},{"FloorId":"3","Id":28},{"FloorId":"1","Id":220}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>Porque nuestra misión es hacer que su estadía en el terminal sea placentera y entregar soluciones ante cada una de las dudas o problemas que pueda tener en su visita, en los mesones de información siempre encontrará a alguien dispuesto a brindarle ayuda en cualquier momento del día.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>Because our mission is to make your experience at the terminal enjoyable and solve any doubts or problems you may have during your visit, our information desk staff are always ready to help you at any hour of the day.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1489712604","Updated":"1489712604","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/148_modulo-de-informacion-nuevo-pudahuel.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/passangers-information\/m%C3%B3dulo-de-informaci%C3%B3n-np","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/informaciones-al-pasajero\/m%C3%B3dulo-de-informaci%C3%B3n-np","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/148_modulo-de-informacion-nuevo-pudahuel.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/148\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/148_modulo-de-informacion-nuevo-pudahuel.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/148\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[]},"HasAdditionalInfo":false}